sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as TemPad
    participant SR as SpeechRecognition
    participant API as HTTPS API
    participant Agent as AI Agent
    participant DB as MySQL
    participant Audio as Audio Layer

    User->>UI: Speak or type
    UI->>SR: Start recognition
    SR-->>UI: Transcript
    UI->>API: POST /api/agent/chat
    API->>Agent: Validate and process message
    Agent->>DB: Read/write authorized state
    DB-->>Agent: Data
    Agent-->>API: Agent response
    API-->>UI: JSON reply
    UI->>Audio: Play authorized asset or synthesize
    Audio-->>User: Spoken response
